*.pyc

# Scratch output belongs in ~/.claude/tmp/, never in a project repo (2026-09-25: seven
# unrelated screenshot PNGs from an earlier scratch task were swept into a commit here
# by an auto-push script's blanket `git add` because this pattern didn't exist yet).
tmp/

# PRIVACY: never publish desktop/terminal screenshots or annotation artifacts.
# (2026-06-28: a Messenger screenshot + terminal captures were committed here by
#  mistake and scrubbed from history. These rules keep that from recurring.)
annotations/
desktop-capture.png
*-capture.png
ss_*.png
annotated_*.png
annotations_*.json
